# Accepted risks. Review these when the network design changes.

# The EKS API endpoint is public but limited to var.admin_cidrs. A private endpoint needs a VPN or bastion host.
AWS-0040

# Worker nodes need outbound access to pull images and reach AWS APIs through the NAT gateway.
AWS-0104

# Event photos use S3-managed AES-256 keys. A customer managed KMS key would add a monthly key fee and a request fee
# for photos of street assets, which hold no personal data.
AWS-0132
